  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UEH-Domestic waste legal support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For the purpose &quot;garbage is a resource&quot;, the segregation of waste at the source is the key to waste treatment. Therefore, the project focuses on solving the following issues: (1) Contribute to Government Decrees and Circulars of the Ministry of Natural Resources and Environment related to domestic waste management; (2) Raise awareness of environmental protection among women (especially housewives) and high school students; (3) Proposing the formation of garbage collection points in each residential area;(4) Engage garbagecollectors to comply with the provisions of the law on garbage collection, only collect garbage when it has been classified and placed in the right place, and collect garbage at the right time and place; (5) Engage local authorities toconduct bidding to select the garbage collection unit in accordance with the standards and regulations; (6) Applying 4.0 technology to the classification, storage and collection of daily-life solid waste.</narrative>
  </description>
